  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Master&apos;s Degree Program in Smart-City Management and Technology(2024)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To cultivate core public policy leaders suitable for the smart city innovation sector to solve urban problems and promote economic development in developing countries, Compose an interdisciplinary curriculum including smart construction and maintenance, smart city transportation planning and demand forecasting, smart city energy systems, smart city and environmental engineering, smart city water resource management, smart city healthcare and communication, smart city and artificial intelligence analysis, and smart city digital design to cultivate talents that meet the demands for building and improving smart city infrastructure in developing countries</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To cultivate global leaders in public sector from developing countries for a Smart City Management and Technology, To help students expand the international partnership in the field of Smart City Management and Technology with Korea and other countries, To increase the human network capability as well as administrative capacity and management capability from developing countries&#xac1c;&#xb3c4;&#xad6d; &#xb3c4;&#xc2dc;&#xbb38;&#xc81c; &#xd574;&#xacb0; &#xbc0f; &#xacbd;&#xc81c; &#xbc1c;&#xc804;&#xc744; &#xc704;&#xd574; &#xc2a4;&#xb9c8;&#xd2b8;&#xc2dc;&#xd2f0; &#xd601;&#xc2e0; &#xbd84;&#xc57c;&#xc5d0; &#xc801;&#xd569;&#xd55c; &#xacf5;&#xacf5;&#xc815;&#xcc45; &#xd575;&#xc2ec; &#xc9c0;&#xb3c4;&#xc790; &#xc591;&#xc131;&#xc744; &#xbaa9;&#xd45c;&#xb85c; &#xc2a4;&#xb9c8;&#xd2b8; &#xd601;&#xc2e0;&#xae30;&#xc220;&#xc5d0; &#xb300;&#xd55c; &#xc804;&#xbb38;&#xc131;, &#xd611;&#xc5c5; &#xc801;&#xc6a9;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xcc3d;&#xc758;&#xc801;&#xc778; &#xbb38;&#xc81c; &#xd574;&#xacb0; &#xb2a5;&#xb825;, &#xc2a4;&#xb9c8;&#xd2b8;&#xc2dc;&#xd2f0; &#xc2dc;&#xc7a5; &#xd655;&#xb300;&#xb97c; &#xc704;&#xd55c; &#xd30c;&#xd2b8;&#xb108;&#xc2ed; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654; &#xcd94;&#xc9c4;</narrative>
  </description>
